      "evidence_index": "I04-var03-idle-system-between-v1.0.1/evidence-index.json",
      "scope": "One accepted BETWEEN source changes SystemTransfer.TFTIME from 8.5 to 10.5 and PDESC. The original child records departure from TEACH-UNIT at 10.5, transit with no unit occupancy, arrival at TEACH-UNIT-2 at 11, unchanged mission at 20–22 and terminal target ready count two. The accepted parent raw is byte-bound and its 4,044-cell report derivation was reviewed at contract stage; frozen postrun replay directly checks all 4,044 child report cells and five predeclared paired differences. Six serial native/checker stages completed with exact converter diagnostics. Accepted parent runs were not repeated.",
      "limits": "Only this fixed source and original child run are supported. The excluded v1.0.0 routing NO_GO and v1.0.1 WTS predispatch hold remain distinct. Two unrelated-chat app-context originals are mandatory local-only and not published as full byte copies. No general transfer law, hidden identity, GUI behavior, performance, cross-engine or whole-I04 claim. Publication takes effect only after reviewed catalog and Git merge."
    },
    {
      "publication_id": "I04.var01.system_between_explicit_units.1.0.0",
      "case_id": "I04",
      "variant_id": "I04.var01",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "package": "I04-var01-system-between-v1.0.0",
      "evidence": "I04-var01-system-between-v1.0.0/cli-scope-signoff-2026-10-05.md",
      "scope": "Bounded fixed-seed SystemTransfer BETWEEN from accepted A17 two-unit group model, with A02/D03/D09 instructional pins. Both arms schedule group missions h8-10 and h20-22. The transfer arm requests TEACH-AIR-01,0 from TEACH-UNIT/BASE-01 to TEACH-UNIT-2/BASE-02 at h8.5 with TFDT0.5 while the first mission is active; the request time is source-frozen rather than separately logged. Native events show the same aircraft transfer out only after returning ready at h10 and transfer in at h10.5. The target has two distinct ready aircraft; both serve the h20 group mission. Aggregate SystemResults shows one in-unit system during transit h10-10.5 and two after arrival, with successful missions, zero failures/damage, terminal two ready. Both 16 row-containing authored-table roundtrips exact, including all-null control placeholder and null TFPRI; 8 guarded SSH0 steps, converter Errors0/Warnings108+126/Notes0, 22 local raw SHA seals, author109/109 and independent439/439 bounded GO. One seed/two explicit units/one system type/BETWEEN only; IN/OUT, PM retention, transfer priority, shortages, implicit units, GUI/cross-engine and full I04 or Issue #18 unverified. Native reports each have one trailing comma normalized only in memory for analysis."
    },
